* name 0..1 string "Name" "The computable name: the CamelCase identifier a Canonical() reference matches on."
* description 0..1 markdown "Description" "A description, as the source gives it."
* otherNames 0..* string "Other names" "Another name the persona is known by."
* iscoCode 0..* string "ISCO code" "An ISCO-08 occupation code (GenericPersona.fsh `iscoCode 0..*`). Usually empty: the committed ActorDefinitions give ISCO in prose."
* personaType 0..1 string "Persona type" "The kind of persona, as declared."
* sourceKind 0..1 string "Source kind" "What kind of artefact the component was read from (an FSH instance, a spreadsheet, a BPMN file)."
* source 0..1 string "Source" "Where the node was read from: a repository path or URL."
