* canonical 0..1 uri "Canonical" "The canonical URL. Only a resolved component carries one."
* description 0..1 markdown "Description" "A description, as the source gives it."
* sourceKind 0..1 string "Source kind" "What kind of artefact the component was read from (an FSH instance, a spreadsheet, a BPMN file)."
* source 0..1 string "Source" "Where the node was read from: a repository path or URL."
